      <p style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;"><h1 style="color: #1e3a8a; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 24pt; border-bottom: 2px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom: 6px;">TAPPY BIRD: SKYBOUND CHALLENGE</h1>
<h2 style="color: #1d4ed8; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 18pt;">Continuous Assessment 2 (CA-2) Project Report</h2>
<strong>Course:</strong> Game Programming  
